        "text": "fetch-tweets consecutive_empty counter is now gap-tolerant. Previously, when fetch-tweets didn't run for a day or two (common during scheduler misses), the silence streak counter reset to 1 — wasting WebSearch queries and missing escalation milestones."
      }
    },
